WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:02.032
A full month in, Maya checks in

2
00:00:02.032 --> 00:00:04.528
with Alex about how things are going.

3
00:00:04.528 --> 00:00:07.279
This is more than a casual conversation.

4
00:00:07.279 --> 00:00:09.984
It is a chance to show self- awareness, talk

5
00:00:09.984 --> 00:00:13.711
honestly about progress, and think about what comes next.

6
00:00:13.711 --> 00:00:15.824
Alex does not need to be perfect.

7
00:00:15.824 --> 00:00:17.740
But by now, the patterns are

8
00:00:17.740 --> 00:00:20.039
starting to show —how Alex handles

9
00:00:20.039 --> 00:00:23.313
pressure, communicates, learns, and builds trust.
